  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この前話していた、\r\nバラエティ番組の件なんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごいぞー！　ほぼ全部OKが出た！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁっ……！　本当ですか！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900303/1009003030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、果穂のことを話したらさ、\r\n果穂を知ってる人はもちろんなんだけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "知らない人も、『プロデューサーさんが\r\nそんなに推す子なら、ぜひお願いしたい』って",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も気合い入れていかないとなって、\r\n身が引き締まる思いだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっか……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900303/1009003030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんも一緒に\r\nあたしをPRしてくれてるんですね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900303/1009003030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんとなら、\r\n絶対絶対ぜーったい、大丈夫です！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900303/1009003030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしたちは、ずっと一緒に戦ってきたので……っ！",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900303/1009003030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは嬉しいな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もな、果穂がとってもいい子だから、\r\n自信をもって売り込めるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……！　えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900303/1009003030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003030080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
